        },
        {
          "text": "Nari nadūganywe uwo musozi no guhabga vya bisate vy’amabuye, ari vyo vyarikw isezerano Uhoraho yasezeranye namwe, nca mmara kur’ uwo musozi imisi mirongwine n’amajoro mirongwine, ata co ntamira, ata n’amazi nnywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
