                  "text": "Gus 4:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamara, abo n’abantu bawe, ni bo cibare cawe, abo wakūjey’ ububasha bgawe buhambaye n’ukuboko kubanguye.",
          "type": "text",
